abstract: >-
  Replication package for the Empirical Software Engineering manuscript
  Measuring Reference Integrity in Coding-Agent Instruction Files: An
  Audited Longitudinal Study. Contains frozen observational exports,
  audit summaries, GFC filter outputs, exploratory RQ5 ledgers,
  protocols, regeneration scripts, and a v1.1.0 validation extension
  (blinded RQ2 audit package, independent human labels, audit-rule
  sensitivity, repository concentration). Science freeze date:
  2026-07-03; validation extension: 2026-07-31. Zenodo version DOI:
  10.5281/zenodo.21716211. Do not mint a new scientific Zenodo version
  for editorial retitling.
